{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S03、S11等短时段的感受提示过密，连续出现时容易来不及扫读；X的并列短词更便于一眼总览。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y虽然更考验观众的阅读速度，但关键词突出、叙事与感受交替、音乐提示按时出现，让人更容易抓住心理转折，也能听出情绪为什么发生变化。尤其是旧歌、舞步、摇篮曲等音乐线索反复出现，使人物的怀念、孤独、犹疑和逐渐接受形成了连续的过程。X胜在一眼总览和简洁，但不少感受停留在情绪标签，Y则更能让普通观众感到音乐具体发生了什么，以及这些声音如何成为人物内心的一部分。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2b79f51f-5d56-4b99-938a-a4509841eb12", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T154624916638Z", "elapsed_seconds": 110.047, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T15:48:14.980339+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e75ab77579ee17dede0fe26b85e54b8d8e58e18fe0bf5061acbff5c3a493d801", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_